&lt;p&gt;Really enjoyed these reflections on LLMs:  &lt;a href=&#34;https://medium.learningbyshipping.com/ai-chatgpt-and-bing-oh-my-79c47e62c666?source=rss----c7cd1239c0de---4&#34;&gt;medium.learningbyshipping.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
